WEBVTT

01:46.080 --> 01:46.640
Got a minute?

01:49.880 --> 01:50.600
How about now?

01:51.680 --> 01:53.200
You make stalkers look easy.

01:53.920 --> 01:54.759
You know,

01:54.759 --> 01:55.720
even stalkers

01:56.600 --> 01:58.280
get some kind of

01:58.280 --> 01:58.920
response.

01:59.000 --> 01:59.440
I'm over here

01:59.800 --> 02:01.480
talking to air,

02:01.560 --> 02:02.480
and you won't even look at me!

02:02.480 --> 02:03.600
My mission is

02:03.600 --> 02:04.400
on another level!

02:04.400 --> 02:05.000
Then

02:05.200 --> 02:06.080
take the hint

02:06.080 --> 02:07.000
and let it go.

02:07.080 --> 02:07.920
Two years.

02:08.000 --> 02:09.440
You've been out two years.

02:09.440 --> 02:10.000
I'm aware.

02:10.600 --> 02:11.280
Are you?

02:11.720 --> 02:13.040
If you don't come back,

02:13.040 --> 02:14.080
they're kicking you out

02:14.080 --> 02:14.560
for good!

02:14.600 --> 02:15.200
Perfect.

02:15.760 --> 02:16.440
Saves me a trip

02:16.680 --> 02:17.680
to the office.

02:18.320 --> 02:19.200
You used to

02:19.200 --> 02:20.400
do a lot of

02:20.400 --> 02:21.200
school activities.

02:22.960 --> 02:25.040
I was,

02:25.079 --> 02:26.079
until my mom got sick.

02:26.400 --> 02:28.440
And you took a gap year?

02:29.400 --> 02:31.120
Yeah... also because of my mom.

02:32.160 --> 02:33.480
She's... gone now.

02:34.520 --> 02:35.280
I'm so sorry.

02:35.320 --> 02:36.840
It's alright. I'm OK now.

02:37.480 --> 02:38.880
You went to

02:38.880 --> 02:39.960
an international school

02:40.120 --> 02:41.240
in Beijing, right?

02:41.360 --> 02:42.800
Your English must be excellent.

02:43.440 --> 02:44.280
I do alright.

02:44.600 --> 02:45.800
I'm usually top three

02:45.920 --> 02:46.720
in my grade.

02:47.720 --> 02:48.520
Here's the deal.

02:49.160 --> 02:49.840
We've got

02:49.840 --> 02:51.440
foreign guests coming.

02:51.680 --> 02:53.240
County's pushing us

02:53.320 --> 02:54.320
to show off

02:54.320 --> 02:56.000
our students'

02:56.280 --> 02:57.160
English skills

02:57.280 --> 02:58.560
and make

02:58.560 --> 02:59.440
a good impression.

02:59.720 --> 03:01.280
I think you'd be

03:01.280 --> 03:02.160
a great fit.

03:02.160 --> 03:02.840
Interested?

03:05.040 --> 03:06.080
I mean...

03:06.800 --> 03:08.800
I really just wanna

03:09.080 --> 03:11.400
buckle down this year.

03:12.160 --> 03:15.640
Extracurriculars aren't

03:15.760 --> 03:17.040
exactly what I had in mind.

03:17.480 --> 03:19.160
Well, if you nail this,

03:19.160 --> 03:20.640
there's a cash prize.

03:21.320 --> 03:22.079
Wait, cash?

03:23.320 --> 03:23.840
How much?

03:24.000 --> 03:24.800
Up to

03:25.160 --> 03:25.800
five grand.

03:31.680 --> 03:32.280
You came

03:32.280 --> 03:33.280
by yourself today?

03:34.040 --> 03:34.440
No,

03:34.520 --> 03:35.480
someone dropped me off.

03:36.600 --> 03:37.480
After you get home,

03:37.480 --> 03:38.480
make sure...

03:39.960 --> 03:41.120
What is he doing here?

03:45.520 --> 03:46.800
Something wrong?

03:46.880 --> 03:47.720
That kid hasn't

03:47.880 --> 03:49.280
shown his face here in ages.

03:49.560 --> 03:50.760
Do yourself a favor,

03:50.760 --> 03:52.040
don't go near him.

03:53.079 --> 03:53.640
Why?

03:54.520 --> 03:55.440
That one's been MIA

03:55.440 --> 03:56.360
for two years,

03:57.160 --> 03:59.000
basically living like a street punk.

03:59.280 --> 04:00.040
Always

04:00.040 --> 04:01.320
getting into fights.

04:01.480 --> 04:02.960
He's bad news.

04:03.160 --> 04:05.080
A sweet girl like you

04:05.240 --> 04:06.560
should keep

04:06.720 --> 04:08.120
your distance.

04:09.240 --> 04:09.680
Got it.

04:10.120 --> 04:11.240
Thanks a lot!

04:11.480 --> 04:12.240
Have a safe trip back.

04:12.640 --> 04:13.360
See you, Ms. Yang.

04:13.480 --> 04:13.880
See ya.

04:15.920 --> 04:17.120
Listen to me.

04:17.600 --> 04:18.839
You are at a

04:18.839 --> 04:19.839
major crossroads in life.

04:20.240 --> 04:21.079
Go home,

04:21.079 --> 04:22.040
talk it over with your mom,

04:22.040 --> 04:22.520
alright?

04:22.520 --> 04:23.640
Sure. On my to-do list.

04:24.920 --> 04:25.600
Oh! You're that

04:25.760 --> 04:28.000
tuk-tuk guy, right?

04:28.480 --> 04:29.280
Oh, right!

04:29.480 --> 04:30.480
Aren't you the stray

04:30.520 --> 04:31.960
he rescued in Beijing?

04:33.080 --> 04:33.720
Listen up,

04:34.080 --> 04:34.960
this boy

04:34.960 --> 04:35.920
has real potential.

04:35.920 --> 04:37.159
He's got a great brain

04:37.480 --> 04:38.320
for math.

04:38.480 --> 04:39.159
Can you please

04:39.159 --> 04:40.159
talk some sense into him?

04:40.159 --> 04:40.600
Mr. Zhu!

04:40.600 --> 04:41.240
Mm-hmm, got it.

04:41.600 --> 04:42.320
- Over here!
- Ms. Yang!

04:42.600 --> 04:43.240
Come on!

04:43.680 --> 04:44.159
Got it.

04:44.480 --> 04:45.280
Work your magic on him!

04:46.840 --> 04:47.480
Come back, alright?

04:50.320 --> 04:51.080
What's up, Ms. Yang?

04:51.440 --> 04:52.560
What took you so long?

04:53.360 --> 04:54.080
Did she trash-talk me?

04:54.440 --> 04:55.760
Oh, big time.

04:57.000 --> 04:57.960
She warned me

04:58.040 --> 04:58.960
to keep my distance.

04:59.240 --> 05:00.240
Apparently,

05:00.400 --> 05:01.280
you're a dangerous,

05:01.840 --> 05:02.680
fist-swinging

05:02.960 --> 05:03.640
street thug.

05:03.800 --> 05:04.680
Total bad news.

05:05.080 --> 05:07.080
And let me guess...

05:07.080 --> 05:08.320
Unfriendly, uncooperative, right?

05:08.520 --> 05:09.160
Are you psychic?

05:09.240 --> 05:10.440
That's been my profile

05:10.440 --> 05:11.240
for ten years.

05:11.720 --> 05:12.320
How boring.

05:15.320 --> 05:16.080
What's so funny?

05:17.680 --> 05:18.440
Imagine

05:19.600 --> 05:20.560
her face

05:20.560 --> 05:21.520
if she found out

05:21.880 --> 05:22.680
about "us."

05:23.120 --> 05:25.000
Xing Wu is her cousin?

05:26.040 --> 05:26.800
Seriously?

05:32.159 --> 05:32.640
Oh,

05:33.520 --> 05:34.159
what's that

05:34.159 --> 05:34.920
tuk-tuk guy doing here?

05:35.880 --> 05:36.640
He was my teacher.

05:36.960 --> 05:37.760
He's a teacher?

05:39.040 --> 05:39.760
He teaches,

05:40.000 --> 05:41.560
but drives for free on holidays.

05:42.080 --> 05:42.720
Community service?

05:43.520 --> 05:44.280
Not exactly.

05:44.720 --> 05:45.760
His wife divorced him

05:45.920 --> 05:46.760
and took everything.

05:47.280 --> 05:48.159
Instead of

05:48.400 --> 05:49.440
moping in his tiny dorm,

05:49.640 --> 05:50.600
he drives

05:50.600 --> 05:51.159
to stay sane.

05:51.720 --> 05:52.520
He's stubborn

05:53.560 --> 05:54.400
as a mule,

05:54.520 --> 05:55.560
but has a heart of gold.

05:56.000 --> 05:56.920
He kept offering

05:56.920 --> 05:57.920
free tutoring to failing kids,

05:58.120 --> 05:58.760
which drove

05:59.120 --> 05:59.720
his ex-wife

05:59.720 --> 06:00.680
crazy.

06:01.040 --> 06:02.640
If he's such a great teacher,

06:02.880 --> 06:04.160
why won't you just

06:04.840 --> 06:05.800
listen to him?

06:09.600 --> 06:10.360
You know

06:10.360 --> 06:11.240
what my life is like.

06:11.400 --> 06:11.840
Let's move.

06:12.520 --> 06:13.440
Don't let her catch us

06:13.440 --> 06:14.040
together.

06:14.720 --> 06:15.440
It's a bad look for you.

06:25.000 --> 06:25.480
Oh,

06:25.960 --> 06:27.360
I need to head out of town.

06:27.480 --> 06:28.680
Take the bus home, OK?

06:29.520 --> 06:30.920
To see Shu Han?

06:31.480 --> 06:31.920
Yeah,

06:32.159 --> 06:32.840
work stuff.

06:34.040 --> 06:35.159
Keep your guard up

06:35.400 --> 06:36.240
on the bus.

06:44.000 --> 06:44.720
Stay safe.

06:54.040 --> 06:56.920
30, 40, 50...

06:58.520 --> 06:59.159
Five grand.

06:59.840 --> 07:00.400
Count it.

07:01.400 --> 07:02.160
Your word

07:02.320 --> 07:02.920
is gold!

07:08.080 --> 07:09.120
Let's stick to our split.

07:16.360 --> 07:17.280
Quanya told me

07:17.320 --> 07:18.640
you're short on cash.

07:20.960 --> 07:21.520
Alright.

07:22.360 --> 07:23.560
Dinner's on me.

07:23.800 --> 07:24.600
Let's grab Quanya.

07:24.800 --> 07:26.000
Thanks for

07:26.720 --> 07:28.160
keeping me fed!

07:29.120 --> 07:30.640
Sorry, handsome.

07:31.240 --> 07:32.440
Got a hot date

07:32.600 --> 07:33.640
tonight.

07:35.640 --> 07:36.080
Sure,

07:36.480 --> 07:37.000
next time.

07:37.400 --> 07:38.159
Hey!

07:38.320 --> 07:39.720
Zero curiosity

07:39.720 --> 07:40.800
about who it is?

07:41.920 --> 07:43.000
You have a packed schedule.

07:43.360 --> 07:44.560
Who am I to pry?

07:46.760 --> 07:48.440
Kinda work-related,

07:49.080 --> 07:49.800
I guess.

07:50.520 --> 07:52.040
My boss' son, Ye Yingjian

07:52.320 --> 07:53.240
just flew back

07:53.240 --> 07:54.760
from an RC plane expo.

07:54.840 --> 07:55.960
I'm picking him up.

07:56.680 --> 07:57.400
An RC plane expo?

07:57.800 --> 07:58.360
Yep.

07:59.000 --> 08:00.240
Boss loved the plane

08:00.240 --> 08:01.480
you made.

08:02.040 --> 08:03.000
He gave it to his kid

08:03.000 --> 08:03.760
for the contest.

08:04.560 --> 08:05.600
He might

08:05.720 --> 08:07.080
bring home a trophy.

08:09.400 --> 08:10.040
Good for him.

08:12.080 --> 08:13.240
He's in senior year,

08:13.480 --> 08:15.360
so the boss hired me to be

08:15.480 --> 08:16.440
his personal driver.

08:16.960 --> 08:17.760
Chauffeur duty?

08:18.600 --> 08:19.120
Did you get a raise?

08:19.440 --> 08:20.080
Duh.

08:20.400 --> 08:21.440
A sweet one!

08:22.560 --> 08:23.240
One step closer

08:23.440 --> 08:24.920
to rolling in cash.

08:25.160 --> 08:26.160
From your lips to God's ears!

08:27.320 --> 08:27.960
Oh,

08:28.360 --> 08:29.880
if the kid actually wins,

08:30.080 --> 08:31.240
won't you feel a little gutted?

08:33.120 --> 08:34.440
I got paid.

08:34.600 --> 08:35.679
That's all that matters.

08:36.200 --> 08:36.840
Damn,

08:36.840 --> 08:37.679
love your

08:37.679 --> 08:39.159
attitude!

09:03.320 --> 09:03.880
Ugh, whatever.

09:05.680 --> 09:06.680
I'll do it by hand.

09:10.040 --> 09:10.640
Oh, shoot!

09:14.920 --> 09:16.680
The detergent's in

09:16.680 --> 09:17.720
that yellow mug.

09:18.040 --> 09:18.800
Just use the scoop,

09:18.800 --> 09:20.360
one is plenty.

09:23.800 --> 09:24.280
Grandma,

09:24.640 --> 09:25.480
did I wake you up?

09:25.880 --> 09:27.520
I heard you

09:27.800 --> 09:29.120
bustling around.

09:30.520 --> 09:32.400
First time doing laundry?

09:34.160 --> 09:34.840
Don't worry.

09:35.320 --> 09:36.440
Practice makes perfect.

09:36.840 --> 09:38.280
Plus, you've got me

09:38.600 --> 09:40.240
as your sidekick!

09:40.480 --> 09:41.480
That's a relief.

09:44.240 --> 09:44.920
New clothes

09:45.200 --> 09:46.720
don't need that much.

09:48.000 --> 09:48.920
Got it, Grandma.

10:09.800 --> 10:10.360
Voila!

10:17.480 --> 10:17.960
OK.

10:18.120 --> 10:19.240
Here is good.

10:19.640 --> 10:20.200
Got it.

10:20.560 --> 10:21.640
Thank you.

10:24.640 --> 10:25.360
Sweetheart,

10:26.040 --> 10:26.680
why don't you

10:27.240 --> 10:29.160
sit down and have some tea

10:29.160 --> 10:29.920
with me?

10:30.400 --> 10:31.160
Sure, Grandma.

10:34.040 --> 10:34.880
The tea...

10:35.560 --> 10:36.160
Oh,

10:36.440 --> 10:38.240
right in that drawer.

10:39.000 --> 10:39.520
OK.

10:51.320 --> 10:52.080
See it?

10:57.640 --> 10:58.920
Apparently,

10:59.480 --> 11:02.000
it's some high-end tea.

11:02.800 --> 11:04.680
Comes from the county next door.

11:07.760 --> 11:08.800
Is this much OK?

11:08.840 --> 11:10.600
Yes, that's perfect.

11:13.000 --> 11:13.440
Here you go,

11:14.160 --> 11:14.640
Grandma.

11:14.960 --> 11:15.400
Careful.

11:16.840 --> 11:17.760
Have a sip.

11:26.320 --> 11:27.280
How is it?

11:28.880 --> 11:30.560
Not bitter at all.

11:31.240 --> 11:31.720
I love it.

11:39.640 --> 11:40.240
Grandma,

11:41.520 --> 11:42.560
is something

11:43.400 --> 11:44.720
on your mind?

11:48.160 --> 11:49.400
Actually,

11:50.040 --> 11:51.520
I have a favor to ask.

11:53.440 --> 11:54.000
Anything.

11:55.000 --> 11:57.800
Could you help me convince Wu

11:58.360 --> 12:01.160
to go back to school?

12:03.120 --> 12:05.000
His teacher tried the same

12:05.720 --> 12:07.040
earlier today.

12:07.320 --> 12:08.600
Why did he drop out anyway?

12:12.280 --> 12:13.680
Life hasn't been kind to him.

12:14.720 --> 12:15.880
His dad ran up

12:16.760 --> 12:19.560
gambling debts

12:20.760 --> 12:22.880
and mortgaged our house.

12:25.160 --> 12:26.040
Collectors

12:27.240 --> 12:28.760
harassed us daily,

12:28.960 --> 12:30.680
spraying paint on our walls.

12:31.280 --> 12:32.840
I fell sick,

12:34.120 --> 12:36.320
and his mom's salon

12:36.480 --> 12:38.000
was a total disaster.

12:38.880 --> 12:40.360
To pay for

12:40.400 --> 12:41.520
my medical bills,

12:42.280 --> 12:44.080
he played in a

12:44.280 --> 12:47.120
cash-prize basketball tournament.

12:47.960 --> 12:49.160
And bless him,

12:49.440 --> 12:51.480
he actually won first place!

12:52.280 --> 12:52.920
But

12:53.840 --> 12:55.640
a jealous player

12:57.080 --> 12:58.600
couldn't handle it.

12:59.160 --> 12:59.760
And

13:00.040 --> 13:02.640
slashed his back with a knife.

13:02.960 --> 13:04.920
The wound required dozens of stitches!

13:13.040 --> 13:14.160
So that's where

13:15.480 --> 13:16.800
his scar came from...

13:18.240 --> 13:19.160
What happened then?

13:20.480 --> 13:21.520
The attacker

13:21.520 --> 13:23.240
got locked up,

13:23.560 --> 13:24.400
but

13:25.040 --> 13:26.320
the school still

13:26.880 --> 13:28.760
suspended Wu.

13:29.960 --> 13:31.640
That's unfair! He was the victim!

13:33.720 --> 13:35.320
[He let everyone believe]

13:35.960 --> 13:38.240
[he dropped out because of]

13:38.240 --> 13:39.280
[the suspension.]

13:40.000 --> 13:41.240
[But I knew better.]

13:42.080 --> 13:42.720
[He just]

13:43.880 --> 13:46.240
[wanted an excuse]

13:46.480 --> 13:49.200
[to start working.]

13:49.600 --> 13:50.840
Here you go.

13:57.480 --> 13:58.040
Good.

13:58.840 --> 13:59.960
Be on time next time.

14:12.280 --> 14:13.520
Easy, Grandma.

14:15.640 --> 14:16.400
Sweetie...

14:16.880 --> 14:18.000
did you

14:18.840 --> 14:20.040
see those planes

14:20.080 --> 14:20.920
when you

14:21.240 --> 14:23.240
got the tea?

14:23.920 --> 14:25.840
Wu made those.

14:27.960 --> 14:30.640
He wanted to become a pilot

14:31.880 --> 14:33.840
in the air force.

14:33.960 --> 14:36.120
He was obsessed with planes.

14:41.640 --> 14:42.240
Look,

14:42.720 --> 14:45.520
here's a photo of us.

14:47.080 --> 14:48.400
He was such a brilliant kid.

14:48.600 --> 14:49.240
Even when

14:49.240 --> 14:50.680
he was little,

14:51.000 --> 14:53.400
he could use rubber bands

14:53.800 --> 14:54.880
and wooden boards

14:54.880 --> 14:56.320
to make toys that

14:56.320 --> 14:57.880
flew so high!

15:00.440 --> 15:01.440
And then

15:02.080 --> 15:04.760
he walked away from it all.

15:05.520 --> 15:06.360
But

15:07.400 --> 15:09.000
you don't just

15:09.560 --> 15:10.600
kill a passion

15:11.040 --> 15:12.240
like that.

15:13.680 --> 15:15.440
It breaks my heart to think

15:16.000 --> 15:17.440
he'll regret it one day.

15:21.800 --> 15:23.240
Have you noticed

15:23.720 --> 15:25.120
that metal box

15:25.720 --> 15:26.680
next to his desk?

15:27.640 --> 15:29.160
It's full of

15:30.080 --> 15:31.880
his trophies.

15:32.800 --> 15:34.200
He locked it up,

15:34.400 --> 15:35.440
and hasn't dared

15:36.280 --> 15:38.280
to look inside since.

15:41.840 --> 15:43.640
I know my boy.

15:44.400 --> 15:46.200
You two are close.

15:47.000 --> 15:48.000
Your words

15:48.480 --> 15:49.840
will carry more weight.

15:53.040 --> 15:54.160
My ultimate failure in this life

15:55.040 --> 15:56.120
is that we failed

15:57.280 --> 15:58.600
to give him

15:59.120 --> 16:02.400
the education he deserved.

16:05.600 --> 16:06.360
Sweetheart...

16:06.840 --> 16:08.440
do this one thing

16:08.440 --> 16:09.960
for me.

16:10.160 --> 16:11.400
Convince him, please.

16:17.360 --> 16:17.880
OK.

16:19.440 --> 16:20.120
Grandma.

16:21.720 --> 16:22.680
I'll do my best.

16:28.840 --> 16:29.560
Bless you.

16:35.560 --> 16:36.120
Yo!

16:37.840 --> 16:38.320
What's up?

16:40.960 --> 16:41.520
Is this you?

16:45.400 --> 16:46.680
You used to be a superstar!

16:47.960 --> 16:49.240
Ancient history.

16:50.680 --> 16:52.520
So you really loved planes, huh?

16:54.840 --> 16:55.880
Grandma filled you in, huh?

16:57.920 --> 16:59.120
Yeah,

16:59.440 --> 17:00.680
she told me a lot.

17:01.360 --> 17:02.120
Seriously not giving school

17:02.120 --> 17:02.960
another shot?

17:06.119 --> 17:06.560
I'm good.

17:07.000 --> 17:08.119
What about your dream of aviation?

17:12.079 --> 17:12.839
I outgrew that dream.

17:15.560 --> 17:16.599
You should get some rest.

18:33.240 --> 18:33.720
Morning!

18:41.000 --> 18:42.160
What's with that look?

18:43.040 --> 18:43.680
Is something

18:44.520 --> 18:45.480
off?

18:46.880 --> 18:47.600
Something's missing.

18:54.000 --> 18:54.600
Ah, ponytail!

18:54.720 --> 18:55.160
There...

18:56.240 --> 18:57.120
Better?

19:01.520 --> 19:03.240
Now we're talking.

19:06.400 --> 19:07.440
Listen up.

19:07.760 --> 19:08.280
First-day

19:08.440 --> 19:09.280
survival guide:

19:09.520 --> 19:10.040
first,

19:10.960 --> 19:11.600
don't be flashy.

19:12.160 --> 19:12.600
Second,

19:13.240 --> 19:14.040
don't be a pushover.

19:14.960 --> 19:15.760
And third, above all,

19:16.520 --> 19:17.600
never say we're related.

19:20.800 --> 19:21.440
Got it,

19:21.760 --> 19:22.400
Dad.

19:24.200 --> 19:24.720
Hop on!

19:39.640 --> 19:41.640
I'll play

19:42.160 --> 19:42.880
by your rules.

19:43.360 --> 19:44.560
But in return,

19:45.000 --> 19:45.600
you have to hear

19:45.600 --> 19:46.720
my pitch as well.

19:47.200 --> 19:48.440
One: get an education.

19:48.520 --> 19:49.960
Two: secure a bright future.

19:49.960 --> 19:50.400
Am I close?

19:50.800 --> 19:52.080
Hey, don't steal my lines!

19:53.280 --> 19:54.080
My ears bleed from

19:54.080 --> 19:55.160
Grandma's lectures.

19:55.880 --> 19:56.520
See,

19:56.920 --> 19:59.120
I'm already living the dream.

20:01.000 --> 20:01.760
Those are

20:01.760 --> 20:02.880
Grandma's wishes.

20:03.920 --> 20:04.760
This third one

20:05.280 --> 20:05.760
is mine:

20:06.360 --> 20:07.400
I want us to

20:07.400 --> 20:09.160
make memories in school,

20:09.560 --> 20:10.880
get out of this town,

20:11.480 --> 20:12.800
and welcome a

20:13.040 --> 20:14.040
dazzling future together.

20:21.880 --> 20:22.520
Just hang on!

20:39.280 --> 20:39.960
Right here.

20:41.840 --> 20:43.360
We're not there yet.

20:43.880 --> 20:44.560
Walk.

20:45.240 --> 20:46.360
Get to know the area.

20:50.840 --> 20:52.600
I got you some local escorts.

20:53.360 --> 20:53.960
Escorts?

20:56.080 --> 20:56.960
Sweet Ye-Ye!

20:57.080 --> 20:57.960
Ye, over here!

20:59.600 --> 21:00.520
You guys in uniforms?

21:00.520 --> 21:01.920
That's a major plot twist.

21:02.040 --> 21:02.560
Right?

21:02.720 --> 21:04.240
We scrub up nicely, huh?

21:05.400 --> 21:06.520
I'm out.

21:06.760 --> 21:07.520
See you after class.

21:09.880 --> 21:10.520
Hey,

21:11.000 --> 21:11.720
watch out for her.

21:12.120 --> 21:12.720
No problem.

21:12.760 --> 21:13.640
We got this.

21:15.120 --> 21:15.560
Peace!

21:15.720 --> 21:16.880
Consider it done!

21:18.920 --> 21:19.520
Ye-Ye,

21:20.080 --> 21:21.360
he treats you like a princess.

21:22.120 --> 21:22.760
Then why did he

21:22.760 --> 21:23.720
ditch me here?

21:24.360 --> 21:26.440
He's labeled

21:26.840 --> 21:27.680
"bad news."

21:28.000 --> 21:29.080
He doesn't want his mess

21:29.360 --> 21:30.360
rubbing off on you.

21:30.760 --> 21:31.360
Well,

21:31.640 --> 21:32.640
his loss is my gain!

21:32.640 --> 21:34.080
I'm a certified good boy.

21:34.440 --> 21:34.800
Hey,

21:34.800 --> 21:35.720
if you ever need anything,

21:35.720 --> 21:36.600
I'm here.

21:36.880 --> 21:37.880
I'd take a bullet

21:37.880 --> 21:39.040
for you!

21:40.600 --> 21:41.240
What's so funny?

21:54.240 --> 21:55.880
He's the town's

21:56.040 --> 21:57.320
prime trust fund baby.

21:57.600 --> 21:58.400
His dad is loaded.

21:59.040 --> 22:00.120
Plus,

22:01.160 --> 22:02.240
he's a top student.

22:02.520 --> 22:03.800
Always ranks first in our grade.

22:14.360 --> 22:15.040
Let's go.

22:25.400 --> 22:26.520
Here's the track.

22:27.240 --> 22:27.960
That's the auditorium,

22:28.400 --> 22:29.920
where we do

22:30.160 --> 22:31.240
all the events.

22:31.480 --> 22:32.400
Cafeteria is ahead.

22:33.160 --> 22:35.040
You're in good hands for lunch.

22:36.760 --> 22:37.880
The lunch guy

22:37.880 --> 22:39.080
is his dad's buddy.

22:39.360 --> 22:41.560
We're basically

22:41.560 --> 22:42.640
eating like kings!

22:42.760 --> 22:43.240
Right, dude?

22:45.240 --> 22:46.360
Administration

22:46.520 --> 22:47.360
is behind us.

22:48.040 --> 22:49.240
Academic building

22:49.440 --> 22:50.360
is here.

22:50.640 --> 22:52.080
Lab is over there.

22:53.240 --> 22:55.120
There're five senior classes:

22:55.320 --> 22:56.240
three science classes

22:56.320 --> 22:57.120
and two liberal arts.

22:59.600 --> 23:00.800
- Morning, sir!
- Hello, Mr. Sun.

23:05.800 --> 23:06.400
Good morning, sir.

23:06.720 --> 23:07.240
Wu said

23:07.240 --> 23:08.360
to keep

23:08.400 --> 23:09.280
a safe distance!

23:10.040 --> 23:11.880
We're keeping our distance!

23:13.040 --> 23:14.400
I'm Mr. Sun, head of

23:14.400 --> 23:14.920
Class 1.

23:15.240 --> 23:16.000
Nice to meet you, Mr. Sun.

23:16.640 --> 23:17.880
Welcome to my class!

23:18.040 --> 23:19.240
My creed is:

23:19.240 --> 23:20.080
"make all dreams

23:20.080 --> 23:21.240
come true!

23:21.400 --> 23:21.960
Let those dreams..."

23:21.960 --> 23:22.600
Actually, sir...

23:23.440 --> 23:24.280
I haven't been assigned

23:24.280 --> 23:25.280
to a class yet...

23:26.560 --> 23:27.520
Which class would you join?

23:30.040 --> 23:30.920
Which class are they in?

23:33.360 --> 23:34.120
My class?

23:35.560 --> 23:37.400
Are you sure she's joining us?

23:37.520 --> 23:40.240
We heard her downstairs,

23:40.240 --> 23:40.680
and, and...

23:40.680 --> 23:41.560
Give you the scoop!

23:41.640 --> 23:42.080
Yeah.

23:43.320 --> 23:44.400
Wait, what are you doing here?

23:45.320 --> 23:46.240
Go stand in the hall

23:46.240 --> 23:47.040
for yesterday's stunt!

23:48.360 --> 23:49.080
Where's our star?

23:49.320 --> 23:49.840
She, she...

23:49.840 --> 23:50.880
I brought her myself.

23:53.240 --> 23:54.160
Go back to class.

23:55.760 --> 23:56.440
Mr. Zhu,

23:57.120 --> 23:58.480
is picking classes a big deal?

23:58.520 --> 23:59.440
A big deal?

23:59.760 --> 24:00.280
Nah,

24:00.600 --> 24:01.640
a piece of cake!

24:02.240 --> 24:02.880
So,

24:03.760 --> 24:04.480
Ms. Qing Ye,

24:05.360 --> 24:06.680
which class would you join?

24:07.760 --> 24:08.560
Class 2.

24:08.800 --> 24:09.480
Destiny!

24:09.960 --> 24:11.000
Allow me to introduce myself.

24:11.560 --> 24:12.120
Zhu Feng,

24:12.360 --> 24:13.720
head of Class 2.

24:14.480 --> 24:16.240
Good luck.

24:16.520 --> 24:17.520
Maybe she can

24:17.520 --> 24:18.640
save your class'

24:18.920 --> 24:19.680
failing grades.

24:19.720 --> 24:20.880
You bet!

24:21.680 --> 24:23.360
She definitely will!

24:27.440 --> 24:28.480
Stop slacking!

24:28.560 --> 24:29.320
I can still hear you!

24:29.760 --> 24:30.160
Get lost!

24:30.160 --> 24:30.680
You, shut up!

24:30.960 --> 24:32.800
How did you get

24:32.800 --> 24:34.080
this problem wrong again?

24:34.160 --> 24:35.880
You are the worst class ever!

24:35.880 --> 24:37.080
Hey, rise and shine!

24:40.800 --> 24:41.400
Alright, listen up!

24:41.600 --> 24:42.720
We have a new addition

24:42.720 --> 24:43.440
to Class 2.

24:43.840 --> 24:45.000
Go ahead, Ms. Qing Ye.

24:46.000 --> 24:47.680
Hi, everyone. I'm Qing Ye.

24:47.880 --> 24:48.880
I'm looking forward

24:48.960 --> 24:50.560
to a great year with you!

24:52.920 --> 24:54.080
Clap, guys!

24:56.320 --> 24:57.720
Ms. Qing Ye's here to

24:57.760 --> 24:58.440
crush senior year

24:58.440 --> 24:59.520
with us.

24:59.560 --> 25:00.760
Learning together,

25:00.760 --> 25:01.840
growing together,

25:01.960 --> 25:03.720
taking on the most important year

25:03.720 --> 25:04.640
any of us will face.

25:05.080 --> 25:06.680
Oh, and one more thing.

25:07.440 --> 25:08.240
We've got

25:08.240 --> 25:09.280
foreign guests

25:09.280 --> 25:10.440
stopping by in a few days.

25:10.560 --> 25:11.840
She's going to be

25:12.120 --> 25:13.160
running the welcome

25:13.440 --> 25:14.840
and leading our

25:14.840 --> 25:16.480
English club.

25:19.240 --> 25:19.840
Face the blackboard!

25:22.960 --> 25:23.360
What?

25:23.360 --> 25:24.720
Got a problem?

25:25.600 --> 25:26.560
Just so you know,

25:26.600 --> 25:27.240
she was

25:27.240 --> 25:28.240
a straight-A student

25:28.240 --> 25:29.880
at her old school,

25:29.920 --> 25:30.480
y'know?

25:30.560 --> 25:32.120
Unlike some of our "legends" here!

25:32.480 --> 25:33.600
Looking right at you!

25:34.120 --> 25:34.760
You know,

25:34.760 --> 25:36.040
we have 43 students here.

25:36.560 --> 25:37.560
Yet 40 of you

25:38.080 --> 25:39.000
share

25:39.000 --> 25:40.520
the exact same wrong answer!

25:40.840 --> 25:42.280
So we only have

25:42.280 --> 25:43.480
three honest students, huh?

25:43.800 --> 25:44.520
You guys...

25:44.840 --> 25:45.360
can't even

25:45.360 --> 25:46.640
cheat right!

25:47.600 --> 25:48.640
Mr. Zhu,

25:48.920 --> 25:50.360
maybe...

25:50.360 --> 25:51.120
my seat first?

25:51.440 --> 25:51.920
Right, sorry.

25:52.640 --> 25:54.080
Sit next to Shi Min.

25:54.800 --> 25:55.080
OK.

25:55.080 --> 25:55.960
Can you see the board from there?

25:56.040 --> 25:56.440
Yeah.

25:56.560 --> 25:57.440
Great. Go ahead.

25:58.560 --> 25:59.120
Ugh,

25:59.440 --> 26:00.760
what a snob!

26:04.000 --> 26:04.680
You OK?

26:06.640 --> 26:07.160
I'm fine.

26:07.560 --> 26:08.240
Just some books.

26:10.160 --> 26:10.760
Alright,

26:11.560 --> 26:12.120
break's over.

26:12.120 --> 26:13.040
Focus up, guys.

26:14.040 --> 26:15.440
First day of school... um...

26:15.440 --> 26:16.640
Get back to your seat!

26:18.440 --> 26:19.080
Alright,

26:19.240 --> 26:20.320
let's begin.

26:20.680 --> 26:21.240
All rise!

26:22.360 --> 26:25.160
Good morning, sir!

26:25.160 --> 26:25.680
Sit.

26:26.800 --> 26:27.640
Now,

26:27.840 --> 26:28.800
open your books.

26:29.160 --> 26:30.760
Page 14.

26:31.840 --> 26:33.760
Hey, we've met before.

26:34.760 --> 26:35.720
We have?

26:36.680 --> 26:37.520
Where?

26:37.600 --> 26:38.400
Pay attention...

26:38.480 --> 26:39.280
The market.

26:40.120 --> 26:41.480
It's critical for your grades...

26:41.720 --> 26:42.240
Hi,

26:42.320 --> 26:43.600
discount at Xuan Island!

26:43.720 --> 26:44.480
Check it out.

26:45.440 --> 26:45.960
Hi there,

26:46.280 --> 26:47.840
Xuan Island promo!

26:48.240 --> 26:49.160
Take a flyer!

26:49.480 --> 26:49.920
Here.

26:52.160 --> 26:52.600
Hey,

26:52.880 --> 26:54.360
special deal!

26:54.680 --> 26:55.960
Care to check this out?

27:00.400 --> 27:01.080
Oh!

27:01.720 --> 27:02.400
That was you!

27:04.880 --> 27:05.400
Hey,

27:06.280 --> 27:07.800
are you and Xing Wu close?

27:10.360 --> 27:11.320
What makes you say that?

27:11.840 --> 27:13.920
He was on the flyer.

27:15.240 --> 27:15.640
Right.

27:16.120 --> 27:16.880
I forgot.

27:18.760 --> 27:20.080
He used to be

27:20.080 --> 27:20.880
a legend here.

27:21.080 --> 27:22.040
Everyone knew him.

27:22.480 --> 27:23.320
He was super smart

27:23.320 --> 27:24.840
and won all these trophies.

27:25.200 --> 27:26.360
He was my idol!

27:27.000 --> 27:28.400
What was he like

27:29.000 --> 27:30.000
back then?

27:30.400 --> 27:31.480
No idea.

27:33.800 --> 27:35.320
He was a senior when I started.

27:35.960 --> 27:36.800
Then

27:36.960 --> 27:38.240
he dropped out

27:38.440 --> 27:39.800
and never returned.

27:46.520 --> 27:47.840
Lunch is calling!

27:48.040 --> 27:48.800
Let's grab some food!

27:48.920 --> 27:49.280
Go!

27:50.720 --> 27:51.440
Mr. Zhu!

27:52.120 --> 27:52.880
Yes?

27:52.920 --> 27:53.800
For the VIP visit...

27:53.800 --> 27:55.000
I thought we had to apply first.

27:55.080 --> 27:55.960
Why was I just chosen?

27:56.240 --> 27:57.800
You won first

27:57.800 --> 27:58.640
in public speaking

27:59.240 --> 28:00.200
and hosted

28:00.200 --> 28:01.640
exchange programs.

28:01.960 --> 28:02.480
We checked

28:02.480 --> 28:03.640
your records.

28:04.360 --> 28:05.800
Honestly,

28:05.960 --> 28:06.520
you're in a league

28:06.520 --> 28:07.440
of your own.

28:08.160 --> 28:09.440
I haven't made up my mind yet...

28:09.640 --> 28:10.800
C'mon, it's a no-brainer!

28:11.800 --> 28:12.800
And Ms. Shen said

28:13.040 --> 28:13.800
if you pull this off,

28:13.800 --> 28:14.640
the highest

28:14.880 --> 28:16.400
cash prize is all yours!

28:16.680 --> 28:17.400
OK, I'm sold.

28:17.760 --> 28:18.440
Go get'em!

28:19.440 --> 28:20.440
Ms. Shen,

28:20.960 --> 28:21.920
why was

28:21.920 --> 28:22.640
the hosting gig

28:22.640 --> 28:23.720
handed to the new girl?

28:23.840 --> 28:24.880
What happened to

28:24.880 --> 28:25.640
the fair selection process?

28:26.240 --> 28:27.560
Calm down,

28:27.760 --> 28:28.680
take a seat.

28:30.160 --> 28:30.960
The truth is,

28:31.280 --> 28:32.360
Qing Ye

28:32.360 --> 28:33.520
simply has

28:33.680 --> 28:35.240
much more experience.

28:35.880 --> 28:36.560
Ms. Yang,

28:37.040 --> 28:38.360
these have always

28:38.400 --> 28:39.080
been my gig

28:39.080 --> 28:40.040
with Ye Yingjian.

28:40.400 --> 28:41.800
I've prepped so much for this.

28:42.000 --> 28:43.280
She literally just got here.

28:43.400 --> 28:44.600
It makes zero sense

28:45.040 --> 28:46.040
for her

28:46.400 --> 28:47.400
to represent us!

28:48.000 --> 28:48.760
Valid point!

28:51.440 --> 28:53.120
Which is why I suggest a face-off.

28:53.680 --> 28:54.960
Let the results speak for themselves.

28:56.800 --> 28:57.800
Ms. Cao Fan,

28:58.080 --> 28:58.800
what do you think?

29:00.880 --> 29:01.400
Fine by me.

29:01.800 --> 29:03.440
Fair and square!

29:08.240 --> 29:09.320
OK, ladies.

29:09.480 --> 29:10.960
Read the passage

29:10.960 --> 29:12.000
on this paper.

29:12.920 --> 29:13.720
Ms. Qing Ye, go ahead.

29:14.440 --> 29:17.080
As the sun dipped below the horizon,

29:17.240 --> 29:18.520
the sky erupted

29:18.520 --> 29:20.360
in a symphony of colors,

29:20.720 --> 29:21.680
painting the world

29:21.680 --> 29:23.800
in hues of pink and orange.

29:24.480 --> 29:26.400
It presents a spectacle

29:26.440 --> 29:28.400
of nature's grandeur.

29:29.520 --> 29:31.520
The beautiful No. 1 Middle School

29:31.560 --> 29:32.960
of Anzi County

29:33.160 --> 29:35.400
woke up in this golden sunlight,

29:36.040 --> 29:40.000
what greeted us was not only the rising sun,

29:40.560 --> 29:42.280
but also the students' vibrant

29:42.400 --> 29:47.040
and energetic faces.

29:47.240 --> 29:49.520
Next is Chinese-to-English.

29:49.560 --> 29:50.840
I'll read the Chinese,

29:50.920 --> 29:52.360
you translate:

29:53.120 --> 29:54.720
Anzi County High School

29:54.800 --> 29:57.000
sits on a picturesque coastline.

29:57.360 --> 29:58.800
Blessed with fresh breezes

29:59.040 --> 30:00.240
and spectacular ocean views,

30:00.360 --> 30:02.320
its unique geography

30:02.640 --> 30:05.360
makes it a peaceful haven for students.

30:07.320 --> 30:09.320
Anzi County No. 1 Middle School

30:09.520 --> 30:12.240
is nestled by picturesque seaside

30:12.720 --> 30:14.320
with fresh breezes

30:14.520 --> 30:16.240
and magnificent sea views.

30:16.880 --> 30:20.120
It embraces geographical advantages

30:20.240 --> 30:23.040
and serves as a tranquil haven for students.

30:23.880 --> 30:26.120
Anzi County No. 1 Middle School

30:26.280 --> 30:29.080
is situated in seaside.

30:29.320 --> 30:30.800
There have breezes

30:30.960 --> 30:32.560
and beautiful scenery.

30:32.920 --> 30:34.080
It's student's

30:34.480 --> 30:38.000
quiet harbor.

30:38.520 --> 30:40.520
Now, English-to-Chinese.

30:40.760 --> 30:41.960
Ms. Lan, take over.

30:42.160 --> 30:44.800
The opposite of success is not failure

30:45.000 --> 30:46.040
but doing nothing.

30:46.400 --> 30:51.560
Only people who have extreme adaptability to their environment can survive.

30:52.120 --> 30:53.720
The opposite of success is not failure,

30:53.920 --> 30:55.240
but doing nothing.

30:55.600 --> 30:57.280
Only those who adapt

30:57.360 --> 30:58.320
can survive!

31:01.120 --> 31:03.080
The opposite of success isn't failure,

31:03.480 --> 31:04.640
but inaction.

31:06.520 --> 31:09.280
The desert only keeps the grass that fights.

31:17.240 --> 31:18.760
Desert... eats grass...

31:26.360 --> 31:27.040
Awesome!

31:27.480 --> 31:28.280
Obviously, duh!

31:30.480 --> 31:31.560
Ms. Qing Ye's version

31:31.560 --> 31:33.480
is both poetic and precise.

31:33.960 --> 31:34.760
It is absolutely

31:34.760 --> 31:35.680
spot on.

31:36.160 --> 31:36.840
Thumbs up!

31:40.960 --> 31:42.760
[The opposite of success isn't failure,]

31:43.240 --> 31:44.440
[but inaction.]

31:45.520 --> 31:48.720
[The desert only keeps the grass that fights.]

31:54.280 --> 31:56.720
The desert only keeps...

32:05.240 --> 32:05.880
Ms. Qing Ye,

32:06.560 --> 32:07.080
greetings!

32:07.560 --> 32:08.560
I'm Ye Yingjian,

32:08.800 --> 32:09.560
Class 1 president.

32:10.080 --> 32:11.560
I like English, chemistry,

32:11.760 --> 32:12.680
AC planes, and traveling.

32:12.720 --> 32:13.800
My blood type is AB...

32:13.800 --> 32:14.200
Dude!

32:14.680 --> 32:16.800
Are you sharing your stats

32:17.000 --> 32:18.440
so I can read your fortune?

32:19.520 --> 32:20.600
You read fortunes?

32:22.280 --> 32:22.760
Nah...

32:25.200 --> 32:26.840
Sorry, I got ahead of myself.

32:27.080 --> 32:28.200
I was just really blown away

32:28.200 --> 32:29.480
by your speech.

32:30.120 --> 32:30.760
Honestly,

32:30.880 --> 32:31.800
we don't get

32:32.120 --> 32:33.240
many girls like you

32:33.600 --> 32:35.080
around here.

32:36.160 --> 32:36.920
Thanks.

32:37.560 --> 32:38.840
If that's all,

32:39.400 --> 32:40.080
I've gotta go.

32:42.800 --> 32:44.240
Where do you live?

32:44.600 --> 32:46.320
Do you have your own place here?

32:59.840 --> 33:00.400
All done.

33:02.240 --> 33:02.760
Sure.

33:14.840 --> 33:15.600
So,

33:16.640 --> 33:17.920
how many new followers today?

33:18.840 --> 33:20.080
Wait, you knew?

33:21.200 --> 33:22.320
Why the secrecy?

33:24.840 --> 33:25.640
Take a look.

33:27.920 --> 33:28.480
I was your

33:28.480 --> 33:29.600
21st follower.

33:30.720 --> 33:32.160
149 already.

33:32.360 --> 33:33.960
Not bad

33:34.360 --> 33:35.240
for a start.

33:36.160 --> 33:37.240
I'm just messing around.

33:38.520 --> 33:40.320
You're a natural behind the lens.

33:40.920 --> 33:41.520
Why not turn it

33:41.520 --> 33:42.280
into a career?

33:44.240 --> 33:45.800
Passion doesn't pay the bills.

33:46.240 --> 33:47.240
Plus, I don't

33:47.440 --> 33:48.240
have the cash for that.

33:54.000 --> 33:54.560
True.

33:56.760 --> 33:57.520
Sometimes

33:58.840 --> 33:59.800
you've just gotta roll with it.

34:20.280 --> 34:21.040
Picking someone up?

34:22.400 --> 34:23.560
Qing Ye's first day.

34:23.600 --> 34:24.320
Don't want her getting lost.

34:25.679 --> 34:26.679
Aw, wish I had

34:26.679 --> 34:27.800
a sweet cousin

34:27.800 --> 34:29.320
like you.

34:30.239 --> 34:31.440
Um... Quanya? Ring any bells?

34:31.960 --> 34:32.600
Ugh, don't remind me.

34:33.080 --> 34:34.320
Hop in! The AC is blasting.

34:34.600 --> 34:35.040
Nah,

34:35.560 --> 34:37.159
I've been sitting all day.

34:50.719 --> 34:52.280
Hey, we totally

34:52.600 --> 34:53.520
look like

34:53.520 --> 34:54.520
anxious parents!

34:58.320 --> 34:59.160
Where are you heading?

34:59.640 --> 35:00.440
I can give you a ride.

35:01.360 --> 35:02.600
Zhazhating.

35:02.720 --> 35:03.560
It's out of your way, right?

35:04.280 --> 35:05.560
Zhazhating?

35:07.240 --> 35:08.480
Nah, we can make it work.

35:09.000 --> 35:09.920
I've got a driver,

35:10.160 --> 35:11.240
a little detour

35:11.720 --> 35:12.320
is fine.

35:12.600 --> 35:13.240
Anyone picking you up?

35:13.320 --> 35:13.760
Yes.

35:14.560 --> 35:15.080
Where?

35:16.120 --> 35:16.920
At the gate.

35:22.800 --> 35:23.880
Ms. Shu?

35:25.760 --> 35:26.640
And... Xing Wu?

35:28.840 --> 35:30.280
What are they doing together...

35:31.360 --> 35:32.720
You know that guy,

35:32.920 --> 35:33.640
Xing Wu?

35:35.360 --> 35:36.960
Sort of...

35:42.800 --> 35:44.080
Look who's popular on day one.

35:45.520 --> 35:46.360
Are you here for me?

35:49.640 --> 35:51.080
What brings you here?

35:51.480 --> 35:52.240
Chauffeur duty.

35:52.560 --> 35:53.600
I'm his driver now.

35:54.000 --> 35:55.160
You guys know each other?

35:55.760 --> 35:56.320
Yeah,

35:56.560 --> 35:57.240
she's Xing Wu's...

35:57.240 --> 35:57.720
Tenant!

36:02.240 --> 36:02.680
Exactly.

36:02.960 --> 36:03.480
Tenant...

36:05.240 --> 36:06.120
Makes sense...

36:06.680 --> 36:07.360
Ms. Shu,

36:07.480 --> 36:08.360
let's give them a ride!

36:08.400 --> 36:08.960
No thanks!

36:14.600 --> 36:15.560
Separate ways then!

36:15.960 --> 36:16.440
Let's go.

36:17.240 --> 36:18.040
OK...

36:18.440 --> 36:19.240
Qing Ye,

36:19.480 --> 36:19.960
Bye!

36:20.440 --> 36:21.600
I'll bring you some snacks tomorrow!

36:28.760 --> 36:30.280
So, how was day one?

36:32.640 --> 36:33.760
Followed your advice.

36:34.760 --> 36:35.440
Don't be a pushover.

36:35.960 --> 36:36.800
If they mess with me,

36:37.080 --> 36:38.240
I shut'em down.

36:39.720 --> 36:40.600
That's rule two.

36:41.040 --> 36:42.640
Rule one is: don't be flashy.

36:44.400 --> 36:45.920
That makes no sense.

36:46.440 --> 36:47.240
How am I

36:47.600 --> 36:48.600
supposed to balance both?

36:50.720 --> 36:51.600
Alright, let's hear it.

36:51.680 --> 36:52.560
How were you flashy?

36:55.040 --> 36:56.840
I'm the new student rep

36:56.840 --> 36:58.040
for foreign guests.

36:58.360 --> 36:59.840
And I'll run the English club.

37:00.480 --> 37:01.560
There's a cash prize

37:01.720 --> 37:03.160
if I nail it!

37:06.040 --> 37:06.440
Oh,

37:07.240 --> 37:07.960
I also heard about

37:07.960 --> 37:09.080
your glory days.

37:10.080 --> 37:11.240
My glory days?

37:12.160 --> 37:13.400
Don't be flashy, huh?

37:14.000 --> 37:15.440
Says the guy who's a celebrity in here!

37:16.560 --> 37:17.480
Someone said

37:18.120 --> 37:21.000
you were actually quite smart.

37:22.680 --> 37:24.160
I'm smart enough to make a living.

37:24.480 --> 37:25.680
Plus, the food's better.

37:28.240 --> 37:28.920
What's in the bag?

37:30.600 --> 37:31.560
Fish cakes.

37:34.520 --> 37:35.520
Wow, they look yummy!

37:41.520 --> 37:42.160
Probably cold.

37:42.840 --> 37:43.960
They taste better hot,

37:44.160 --> 37:45.240
especially with spicy pho.

37:46.680 --> 37:48.080
Shouldn't we dip them in ketchup?

37:48.160 --> 37:48.560
Nope.

37:48.840 --> 37:49.560
It's my secret recipe.

37:49.720 --> 37:50.760
You'll see.

37:55.840 --> 37:56.520
Take it easy.

37:57.360 --> 37:58.400
So good!

37:58.560 --> 37:59.560
Got some on your face.

38:00.040 --> 38:00.760
I can't believe

38:01.600 --> 38:03.320
they go so well

38:03.360 --> 38:04.240
together!

38:04.640 --> 38:05.240
Grandma used to

38:05.240 --> 38:06.400
make this for me.

38:06.680 --> 38:08.240
They have absolutely

38:08.480 --> 38:09.040
nothing

38:09.040 --> 38:10.040
in common,

38:10.400 --> 38:11.800
but they're made for each other.

38:13.040 --> 38:13.720
That actually

38:14.600 --> 38:16.120
sounds like us.

38:18.080 --> 38:18.800
We're from

38:19.320 --> 38:20.560
totally different worlds,

38:20.640 --> 38:21.800
yet here we are, living under one roof.

38:23.680 --> 38:24.360
Turns out,

38:25.360 --> 38:27.240
the weirdest combos

38:27.240 --> 38:28.280
are the best!

38:37.760 --> 38:38.960
Flying isn't

38:39.400 --> 38:40.600
the only dream out there.

38:41.760 --> 38:42.680
If you can't fly,

38:42.680 --> 38:43.840
you can do something else.

38:44.960 --> 38:45.560
There're

38:46.360 --> 38:47.280
a million ways

38:47.280 --> 38:48.360
to get where you want.

38:49.560 --> 38:50.360
You can fly,

38:50.800 --> 38:51.600
you can run,

38:52.320 --> 38:52.960
or you can crawl,

38:53.680 --> 38:54.320
as long as you keep moving.

38:57.320 --> 38:58.720
Paper planes don't

38:59.080 --> 38:59.920
stay up forever.

39:01.160 --> 39:02.320
They always have to face gravity.

39:09.720 --> 39:11.080
Besides, success is relative.

39:11.840 --> 39:13.280
Some dreams are out of reach,

39:13.720 --> 39:14.520
but others are

39:15.160 --> 39:15.920
right in front of you.

39:22.440 --> 39:23.000
[Yo,]

39:23.160 --> 39:24.440
[you free tomorrow morning?]

39:24.840 --> 39:25.640
[I need a hand.]

39:26.080 --> 39:26.800
[Paid gig!]

39:33.720 --> 39:35.040
Seems like the businessman in you

39:36.520 --> 39:38.320
is beating the dreamer.

39:43.160 --> 39:43.960
Can't argue with that.

39:45.080 --> 39:46.400
I'm more of a boss type.

40:07.480 --> 40:10.160
Tofu, tofu,

40:10.600 --> 40:12.920
fresh and bold!

40:14.000 --> 40:16.400
Get it now before it's cold!

40:21.720 --> 40:22.360
Morning!

40:24.960 --> 40:25.680
What do you want?

40:25.960 --> 40:26.880
Is Qing Ye around?

40:28.400 --> 40:29.000
Nope.

40:30.280 --> 40:31.000
Where'd she go?

40:31.320 --> 40:32.000
Beats me.

40:32.720 --> 40:34.720
Dude, where are my earbuds?

40:35.000 --> 40:35.600
Qing Ye!

40:37.400 --> 40:38.160
Ye Yingjian?

40:39.640 --> 40:40.240
You've got a visitor.

40:40.960 --> 40:41.800
What are you doing here?

40:42.080 --> 40:43.360
To practice our lines!

40:44.880 --> 40:46.360
Dude, you kidding?

40:46.360 --> 40:47.040
We said

40:47.040 --> 40:48.600
lunchtime at school!

40:48.840 --> 40:49.640
Yeah,

40:49.920 --> 40:51.040
just wanted to

40:51.040 --> 40:52.400
get a head start.

40:53.000 --> 40:54.120
And I brought breakfast!

40:54.360 --> 40:55.440
Let's eat

40:55.720 --> 40:57.040
and practice.

40:58.080 --> 40:58.840
Alright,

40:59.280 --> 41:00.240
let's prep and

41:00.640 --> 41:01.680
shut those

41:01.760 --> 41:02.640
haters up!

41:02.720 --> 41:03.240
Awesome!

41:04.320 --> 41:04.800
C'mon.

41:15.840 --> 41:18.320
Fresh and bold!

41:26.560 --> 41:27.240
Dig in!

41:27.840 --> 41:28.720
OMG...

41:29.160 --> 41:30.400
No way we can finish these...

41:30.480 --> 41:31.360
I wanted to

41:31.600 --> 41:33.040
give you options.

41:33.480 --> 41:34.400
I'll figure out

41:34.640 --> 41:35.680
your taste soon enough.

41:42.120 --> 41:42.640
So,

41:43.080 --> 41:44.000
how good is

41:44.120 --> 41:45.760
the English here?

41:46.240 --> 41:47.000
Honestly,

41:47.000 --> 41:48.800
only the teachers are OK.

41:49.760 --> 41:50.720
You heard Cao Fan

41:50.720 --> 41:51.920
the other day.

41:52.560 --> 41:54.080
She's about as good as it gets.

41:54.480 --> 41:55.840
If my dad hadn't sent me

41:55.840 --> 41:56.920
to overseas summer camps,

41:57.240 --> 41:58.600
I'd probably be just as bad.

42:02.120 --> 42:02.600
Oh,

42:02.880 --> 42:03.920
check out

42:04.240 --> 42:06.280
the outline for me.

42:35.120 --> 42:35.600
Hold on...

42:36.680 --> 42:37.680
Why did you write

42:37.680 --> 42:38.400
"sporting house" for gym?

42:41.000 --> 42:42.440
What?

42:42.840 --> 42:43.400
What's wrong?

42:44.120 --> 42:45.480
Should be "gymnasium."

42:45.600 --> 42:46.840
"Sporting house" is a gambling joint.

42:46.920 --> 42:48.600
If our guests think

42:48.640 --> 42:50.680
we run a gambling den on campus,

42:51.040 --> 42:51.520
they'll be

42:51.680 --> 42:52.880
shocked!

42:53.520 --> 42:54.800
Gymnasium?

42:58.560 --> 42:59.480
You're right...

43:00.360 --> 43:01.480
Thanks for saving me

43:02.160 --> 43:03.480
from making a total fool

43:03.480 --> 43:04.160
of myself.

43:05.400 --> 43:07.000
Hey, you're doing great.

43:07.240 --> 43:08.280
Your grammar

43:08.320 --> 43:09.160
is solid.

43:09.640 --> 43:10.080
Keep it up!

43:11.000 --> 43:12.240
That isn't enough.

43:12.560 --> 43:13.920
I want us

43:14.920 --> 43:15.840
to be...

43:17.520 --> 43:18.720
perfect together!

43:25.240 --> 43:27.160
Perfect for the guests...

43:30.680 --> 43:31.160
Dumb flies.

43:32.760 --> 43:33.760
Wu,

43:33.800 --> 43:35.440
what's all the noise?

43:35.440 --> 43:37.480
Do we have a bug problem?

43:37.600 --> 43:38.240
Yeah,

43:38.400 --> 43:39.760
a huge one.

43:40.000 --> 43:41.160
Some pest just won't leave.

43:43.120 --> 43:43.760
Good morning, ma'am!

43:44.560 --> 43:45.160
Morning, Grandma!

43:45.520 --> 43:47.000
A friend from school?

43:47.960 --> 43:49.080
Here to study?
